{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把整数问题翻译成分析问题的准备工作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/analytic-number-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-analytic","title":"为何解析数论：让连续的分析去审问离散的整数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/analytic-number-theory/foundations/why-analytic","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"prime-distribution","title":"素数分布问题：这门学科要攻克的目标清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/analytic-number-theory/foundations/prime-distribution","wordCount":1417,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"arithmetic-functions","title":"算术函数与卷积：解析推导的原材料车间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/analytic-number-theory/foundations/arithmetic-functions","wordCount":1386,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-把整数问题翻译成分析问题的准备工作\">基础：把整数问题翻译成分析问题的准备工作</h1><p>这一章不急着证明任何大定理，它做的是打地基的活——搞清楚我们到底要解决什么问题，以及手里有哪些原材料。三篇文档各管一段互不重叠的内容。</p>\n<p>第一篇《为何解析数论》回答方法论问题：素数是离散的，为什么用连续函数反而更有效？它给出这门学科的历史脉络与核心思想——Dirichlet 级数是连接算术与分析的桥梁，一切从这里开始。它只做纲领性介绍，具体的函数和定理留给后面。</p>\n<p>第二篇《素数分布问题》把这门学科要攻克的目标一次性摆上台面：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 如何增长、素数如何变稀、素数间隙有多大、孪生素数与 Goldbach 猜想说了什么。它只陈述问题与经验事实（包括 Chebyshev 的初等上下界），而把这些问题的解答分派给后面的「素数」章与「方法」章——本篇是问题清单，不是答案。</p>\n<p>第三篇《算术函数与卷积》搭起代数脚手架：Möbius 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、Euler 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span>、von Mangoldt 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span>、除数函数，以及把它们黏合起来的 Dirichlet 卷积与 Möbius 反演。这些是后面每一个解析推导的原料，尤其是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span>——它是连接 zeta 函数与素数计数的关键齿轮。</p>\n<p>在整个 hub 中，本章是入口和词汇表：读完这三篇，你会知道问题是什么、工具的名字叫什么，然后才能进入「zeta」章看这些工具如何被真正启动。前置只需微积分、无穷级数和一点初等数论。</p>\n"}